<i><b>Upgrade Notes</b></i>

Requires NSP Version 1.46.2.0 or newer.

<b>V2.33.1 Release</b>

<i><b>Fixes</b></i>

* Fixed an issue that would cause the "OK" button to remain greyed out on the Wi-Fi configuration panel in NSP, even after applying the SSID and password.

* Fixes <b>Fuel Level Sensor</b> ignoring <i>Input Type</i> setting.

<b>V2.33.0 Release</b>

<i><b>Features</b></i>

* Added new <b>Vehicle Functions</b>
    * Intercooler System
    * Nitrous Bottle Opener
    * Exhaust Cutout

* Added humidity sensors to all dashes

* External Devices now display serial numbers, if available.
* Added separate Bar Markings and Peak Needle colours to the colour palette

* Supports Peak needle display configuration in Dash for Dial, Bar and Numeric components

<i><b>Changes</b></i>

* Added Channels to all dashes
    * Average Fuel Mileage
    * Instantaneous Fuel Mileage

* Added Transmission Oil Temperature Switch Input

* Added <b>Oil Over temperature</b> channel to all dashes

<b>Fixes</b>

* Fixes an issue with restoring sensor type for external NTK wideband boxes.

* Corrected the interpretation of <b>TMS-4</b> channel values in case device is not enabled under <i>Haltech CAN System</i>.

* Fixes Trip meters resetting to zero during firmware upgrade.

* Fixes <b>Holley EFI</b> third party protocol not recieving data.

* Fixes the <b>Wideband Run Conditions</b> setting visually overlapping the settings below it in NSP.
